{"seq":1,"slug":"reflection-refraction","title":"反射与折射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-water-rendering/shading/reflection-refraction","wordCount":1662,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"反射与折射\">反射与折射</h1><p>光打到水面会分岔成两束：一束被弹回，把天空和岸景映成倒影；一束钻进水里，按斯涅尔定律拐个弯，让你隔着扭曲的水面看见水下的石头和鱼。这一反一折，是&quot;水看起来湿&quot;最核心的两条视觉线索——少了反射，水不会亮、不像液体；少了折射，水下景物贴得死板、像一张平铺贴图。本篇专讲如何在实时管线里采样这两束光：反射有平面反射、屏幕空间反射、立方体贴图三条路线，折射则几乎总用抓屏纹理加扰动。至于这两束按什么比例混合，由菲涅尔决定，那是下一篇 <a href=\"fresnel-depth\">菲涅尔与深度色</a> 的事，本篇只管&quot;怎么采到这两束&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>反射三路</strong>：平面反射（质量高但仅限单一平面、大水面贵）、屏幕空间反射 SSR（贴合波形但屏幕外信息缺失）、立方体贴图（便宜但无动态近景）；主流是&quot;SSR 为主 + cubemap 兜底&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>折射抓屏近似</strong>：不解斯涅尔光线，而是把已渲染的不透明场景抓成纹理，按法线水平分量偏移采样 UV，并用深度裁剪防止采到水面以上物体。</li>\n<li><strong>法线扰动</strong>：反射方向与折射偏移都靠 <a href=\"../waves/\">波形</a> 法线扰动，法线的高频细节直接决定倒影的细碎程度。</li>\n<li><strong>分工</strong>：本篇只负责采到两束光，染色交给 <a href=\"fresnel-depth\">深度色</a>、配比交给菲涅尔。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反射的三条路线\">反射的三条路线</h2><p>实时反射没有免费午餐，三种主流做法在质量、成本、适用范围上各有取舍。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>质量</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>短板</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平面反射</td>\n<td>以水面为镜把场景再渲一遍</td>\n<td>高（含动态物体）</td>\n<td>高（多一遍 draw）</td>\n<td>仅限单一平面、大水面贵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屏幕空间反射 SSR</td>\n<td>在已渲染的屏幕缓冲里沿反射方向 ray-march</td>\n<td>中高（贴合波形）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>屏幕外信息缺失、边缘穿帮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>立方体贴图</td>\n<td>采样预烘焙/实时的环境立方图</td>\n<td>中（远景好）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>不含动态近景、视差错位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实践里常组合使用：远景天空与远岸用立方体贴图兜底，近景动态物体用 SSR 补，SSR 失败（射线打出屏幕或被遮挡）时回退到立方体贴图。这种&quot;SSR 为主、cubemap 兜底&quot;的混合，是 2026 年主流引擎水面反射的默认形态。平面反射则保留给反射质量要求极高、水面又是单一平面的场景（如静止湖面、室内泳池）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用波形法线扰动反射\">用波形法线扰动反射</h2><p>无论哪条路线，死板地反射都不对——真实水面在起伏，倒影必须随波纹晃动破碎。关键一步是用 <a href=\"../waves/\">波形</a> 章算出的法线去扰动反射方向。对镜面反射，反射向量按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>R</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>I</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>I</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{R} = \\vec{I} - 2(\\vec{I}\\cdot\\vec{N})\\vec{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1244em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2163em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1244em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2163em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 计算，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{N}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是被波形（正弦/Gerstner/FFT 法线贴图）扰动后的法线。法线的高频细节直接决定倒影的细碎程度：平静湖面法线接近竖直、倒影清晰，大风海面法线乱、倒影被打散成闪烁的光点。这把上游波形和下游着色真正接通了——波形不只决定几何轮廓，还通过法线决定反射的样子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"折射-抓屏-扰动\">折射：抓屏 + 扰动</h2><p>折射的物理是斯涅尔定律：光从空气（折射率约 1.0）进入水（约 1.33）会向法线方向弯折，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_1 \\sin\\theta_1 = n_2 \\sin\\theta_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。但实时渲染几乎不会真去解斯涅尔光线，而用一个极其便宜的近似：把当前帧已渲染好的不透明场景抓成一张纹理（grab pass / scene color），在水面像素处按法线的水平分量给采样 UV 加一点偏移，采出来的就是&quot;被扭曲的水下景物&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>N</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>z</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">uv_{refract} = uv_{screen} + \\vec{N}_{xz} \\cdot s \\cdot \\frac{1}{depth}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ee</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1163em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9663em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1522em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>扰动强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 控制扭曲程度，再除以深度让近处扭曲强、远处收敛，符合直觉。这一招省去了所有真实折射计算，效果却足够可信。它有个经典坑：偏移后的 UV 可能采到水面之上的物体（比如岸上插在水边的木桩），造成&quot;水里映出岸上东西&quot;的穿帮，需要用深度比较把采样点裁回水面以下。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  I[入射视线] --&gt; SF[水面像素]&#10;  N[波形法线] --&gt; SF&#10;  SF --&gt; REFL[反射方向 R]&#10;  SF --&gt; REFR[折射UV偏移]&#10;  REFL --&gt; M1{SSR命中?}&#10;  M1 --&gt;|是| SSR[屏幕空间颜色]&#10;  M1 --&gt;|否| CUBE[立方体贴图兜底]&#10;  REFR --&gt; GRAB[抓屏纹理采样]&#10;  GRAB --&gt; DCHK[深度裁剪:剔除水面以上]&#10;  SSR --&gt; MIX[菲涅尔混合]&#10;  CUBE --&gt; MIX&#10;  DCHK --&gt; MIX&#10;  MIX --&gt; OUT[水面颜色]\">flowchart TD\n  I[入射视线] --&gt; SF[水面像素]\n  N[波形法线] --&gt; SF\n  SF --&gt; REFL[反射方向 R]\n  SF --&gt; REFR[折射UV偏移]\n  REFL --&gt; M1{SSR命中?}\n  M1 --&gt;|是| SSR[屏幕空间颜色]\n  M1 --&gt;|否| CUBE[立方体贴图兜底]\n  REFR --&gt; GRAB[抓屏纹理采样]\n  GRAB --&gt; DCHK[深度裁剪:剔除水面以上]\n  SSR --&gt; MIX[菲涅尔混合]\n  CUBE --&gt; MIX\n  DCHK --&gt; MIX\n  MIX --&gt; OUT[水面颜色]</pre><h2 id=\"折射看到什么-交给深度色\">折射看到什么：交给深度色</h2><p>折射采到的&quot;水下景物&quot;只是水底物体的原始颜色，还不是水的真正观感——真实的水会随深度把这份颜色染蓝染绿、越深越暗，因为光在水里被吸收。这一步属于深度色，由下一篇主讲，本篇只在管线图里留出&quot;折射颜色 → 按深度上色&quot;的接口。换句话说，反射折射负责&quot;采到两束光&quot;，深度色负责&quot;给折射那束染上水的颜色&quot;，菲涅尔负责&quot;两束按视角配比&quot;，三者接力完成水面着色。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能与穿帮清单\">性能与穿帮清单</h2><p>反射折射是水着色里最容易吃性能也最容易穿帮的环节，落地时盯紧这几条：平面反射在大世界里会让水域翻倍渲染，务必只对必要水体启用并降分辨率；SSR 的射线步进步数与水面占屏比直接挂钩，远景海面慎用高步数；抓屏折射要求水面用半透明/自定义 pass 在不透明物之后绘制，排序错了就采不到水下；移动端带宽紧张，grab pass 全屏抓屏代价不小，常改用低分辨率折射缓冲。这些屏幕空间技巧的通用实现细节，可参阅 <a href=\"../../game-graphics/post-processing/screen-space-effects\">游戏图形 · 屏幕空间效果</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>反射有平面反射、SSR、立方体贴图三路，主流用&quot;SSR 为主 + cubemap 兜底&quot;，平面反射留给单一平面高质量场景。</li>\n<li>折射几乎都用&quot;抓屏纹理 + 法线扰动 UV&quot;的便宜近似，需用深度裁剪防止采到水面以上物体。</li>\n<li>反射与折射都靠 <a href=\"../waves/\">波形</a> 法线扰动才显得在动，法线高频决定倒影细碎程度。</li>\n<li>本篇只负责采到两束光；染色交给 <a href=\"fresnel-depth\">菲涅尔与深度色</a>，配比也由菲涅尔决定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章下一篇：<a href=\"fresnel-depth\">菲涅尔与深度色</a> —— 反射/折射按什么比例混合、折射如何被染成水色。</li>\n<li>上游：<a href=\"../waves/fft-ocean\">FFT 海洋谱</a> —— 反射折射所用法线的来源之一。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../game-graphics/post-processing/screen-space-effects\">游戏图形 · 屏幕空间效果</a> —— SSR 与抓屏折射的通用底层实现。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../shader-programming/advanced-effects/post-processing\">着色器编程 · 后处理</a> —— grab pass 与屏幕缓冲采样的写法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"反射与折射","id":"反射与折射"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"反射的三条路线","id":"反射的三条路线"},{"level":2,"text":"用波形法线扰动反射","id":"用波形法线扰动反射"},{"level":2,"text":"折射：抓屏 + 扰动","id":"折射-抓屏-扰动"},{"level":2,"text":"折射看到什么：交给深度色","id":"折射看到什么-交给深度色"},{"level":2,"text":"性能与穿帮清单","id":"性能与穿帮清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"FFT 海洋谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-water-rendering/waves/fft-ocean"},"next":{"title":"菲涅尔与深度色","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-water-rendering/shading/fresnel-depth"}}